{"id":"n18669-1-8","stage":2,"title":"곳곳 · 到处","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18669-1-8-1","ko":"집안 곳곳에서 좋은 향기가 나.","zh":"家里到处都散发着好闻的香气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집안","meaning":"家庭","explanation":"집안：家庭。","readings":[{"term":"집안","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71361","senseId":"1","lemma":"집안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집안","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3"}},{"text":"곳곳에서","meaning":"到处，各地，处处，各处","explanation":"곳곳：到处，各地，处处，各处；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"곳곳","audio":"/audio/a6cae037c9233c8a18e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18669","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳곳에서","audio":"/audio/068787d2bb7c73c4fdad.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，强","explanation":"좋다：好，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"15","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"향기가","meaning":"香气，香味","explanation":"향기：香气，香味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"향기","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72483","senseId":"1","lemma":"향기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"향기가","audio":"/audio/66c998df4ece7c530fcd.mp3"}},{"text":"나.","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2474242906f4997e","term":"집안","zh":"家庭","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3","entryId":"71361","definition":"以家人为成员生活的共同体；或指近亲。","pronunciation":["지반"]},{"id":"a6cae037c9233c8a","term":"곳곳","zh":"到处，各地，处处，各处","audio":"/audio/a6cae037c9233c8a18e3.mp3","entryId":"18669","definition":"好几个地方；或指各个地方。","pronunciation":["곧꼳"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，强","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"和别的相比，质量或水平等更高。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"913f16597fe350c3","term":"향기","zh":"香气，香味","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3","entryId":"72483","definition":"好闻的味道。","pronunciation":["향기"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/13f37c6fa4fd4aea519c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18669-1-8-2","ko":"거실이랑 방마다 꽃을 가져다 놨거든.","zh":"我已经在客厅和每个房间里都放了花。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"거실이랑","meaning":"客厅","explanation":"거실：客厅；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"거실","audio":"/audio/f75d2664aecb37c813ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66304","senseId":"1","lemma":"거실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거실이랑","audio":"/audio/06cdbd8df54d59e045ff.mp3"}},{"text":"방마다","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방마다","audio":"/audio/68d6438c422771b1e113.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃을","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃을","audio":"/audio/f2e431e87f02267d34e6.mp3"}},{"text":"가져다","meaning":"持，带，戴","explanation":"가지다：持，带，戴；어다：表示先完成前一动作，再利用其结果进行后续动作。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져다","audio":"/audio/6317ad5afbe854042046.mp3"}},{"text":"놨거든.","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놨거든","audio":"/audio/0046bf27e6e6669d0e90.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f75d2664aecb37c8","term":"거실","zh":"客厅","audio":"/audio/f75d2664aecb37c813ca.mp3","entryId":"66304","definition":"在西式房屋里，家人会聚或招待客人的主要空间。","pronunciation":["거실"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"持，带，戴","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"手里握着或身上携带着某物。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/6979e619db9dbdb6e182.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.215,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18669","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":68,"sequenceScore":1.8126,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["家里到处都散发着好闻的香气。","我已经在客厅和每个房间里都放了花。","汇率涨了很多呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["家里到处都散发着好闻的香气。","我已经在客厅和每个房间里都放了花。","汇率涨了很多呢。"],"answer":1}]}
